# Agent start path

Before opening AGENTS.md, worklogs, or FEATURES:

1. Read [`AGENTS-START-HERE.md`](AGENTS-START-HERE.md) (task → file → stop).
2. Read [`docs/todo/INDEX.md`](docs/todo/INDEX.md) for open work.

Do not skim `docs/todo/` or `UI-REDESIGN-WORKLOG.md` for “what’s next”. Done work folds into `docs/todo/HISTORY.md` and is deleted from `docs/todo/`.
